      "statement": "All HTTP collectors use the `request(method, url, params) -> TransportResponse` seam, while `BaseCollector` owns rate limiting and retry behavior; the real requests-backed transport imports its dependency only on construction, so the same collection policy can wrap live, replay, or recording traffic.",
